[{"title":"送钱氏两甥度岭","author":"高启","text":"东送投荒去，应归下濑营。\n一家十口散，万里两身行。\n洞獠欺商市，山魈唤客名。\n江边南望泣，不尽渭阳情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客归闽省觐","author":"高启","text":"秋城闻暮砧，归思忽盈襟。\n客久依人遍，亲衰念子深。\n青山分岭路，红荔到乡林。\n菽水还堪乐，何须季子金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圆明佛舍访吕山人","author":"高启","text":"怜君不出院，结夏与僧同。\n阴竹行廊远，香花掩殿空。\n饭分斋钵里，书寄藏函中。\n茶宴归来晚，西林一磬风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答宗人廉夜饮王氏池亭见怀","author":"高启","text":"遥闻池上酌，凉夜失炎天。\n酒碧倾当竹，衣香坐近莲。\n沿波人弄月，翻树鸟鸣烟。\n座上谁相忆，唯应是惠连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得蝉送别","author":"高启","text":"疏槐细柳中，凉占一枝风。\n蜕出形犹弱，惊飞响未终。\n雨来林馆静，日下驿门空。\n离管尊前发，凄凉调正同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何隐君小墅","author":"高启","text":"移家营别墅，□径竹扉开。\n泉满疏渠放，花多借地栽。\n壁间田器挂，窗里浦帆来。\n自恋居幽乐，谁言是弃材。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张明府","author":"高启","text":"闻道弹琴处，门前柳带沙。\n海珍通估市，湖税减渔家。\n暮港迷荷叶，秋田开豆花。\n乱来无此地，君政亦堪夸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送唐博士肃移家醉李","author":"高启","text":"杨柳发初齐，春阴废苑西。\n故人乘醉别，新鸟傍愁啼。\n舟重全家去，诗多一路题。\n杏花开北郭，谁复共招携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠妓","author":"高启","text":"乐籍小名收，侯家旧主讴。\n笑能撩客喜，醉肯逐人留。\n蝶识薰香气，莺惭度曲喉。\n更怜谙酒令，少日住扬州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾倅之钱塘","author":"高启","text":"之官即胜游，送别漫多愁。\n草色荒宫燕，槐阴远驿驺。\n湖通朝汲井，潮动夜眠楼。\n早向临平过，荷花已欲秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答高廉同饮后见寄","author":"高启","text":"竹林清暑宴，客散独归时。\n愁寄欢余别，醒惭醉后诗。\n蝉催斜景急，鸟度广川迟。\n何事闻钟处，劳君尚远思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈征士铉野亭","author":"高启","text":"清时犹在野，独卧见高情。\n移艇闻烟唱，钩帘看雨耕。\n江晴双鹳下，树晚一牛鸣。\n回首徒相忆，柴车不入城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠朱山人","author":"高启","text":"老来嫌众累，依涧独开房。\n积雨苔生桁，回风叶满床。\n学僧持净律，避客录奇方。\n若问尘中事，无闻不是忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上","author":"高启","text":"秋色共溪长，游人笑语凉。\n萍开天倒影，莲堕水流香。\n鱼罶和星漉，禽罝带雨张。\n从今摇桂棹，不必问潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨仪曹雨中","author":"高启","text":"雨中池阁晓，清簟荐文漪。\n阴恐晴期远，寒疑暑候迟。\n荷高擎欲折，柳重舞难欹。\n应阻陪高咏，开帘看散丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钱塘诸故人","author":"高启","text":"年少客名都，狂游每共呼。\n荷深筝在舫，竹静矢鸣壶。\n明月潮千里，残阳雨半湖。\n故人能念否，欢意近来无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送乌城冯明府","author":"高启","text":"青山若下南，一骑入晴岚。\n县治琴声古，泉香酒味甘。\n竹栏春护鸭，苇箔夏分蚕。\n大小冯君后，传家尔最堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病目","author":"高启","text":"闭目洗黄连，深窗坐兀然。\n未忘听鸟兴，暂绝看花缘。\n问女知檐日，嗔奴畏灶烟。\n愿因无见处，得证定心禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病目不饮","author":"高启","text":"患目未全明，医教谢曲生。\n暂从彭泽止，恐学左丘盲。\n壁下兰尊掩，林间药臼鸣。\n坐听连日雨，何物慰闲情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得蟹送人之官","author":"高启","text":"吐沫乱珠流，无肠岂识愁。\n香宜橙实晚，肥过稻花秋。\n出簖来深浦，随灯聚远洲。\n郡斋初退食，可怕有监州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上早发","author":"高启","text":"苍苍汀雾起，何处望高城。\n游子晓初发，居人寒未耕。\n犬鸣林月落，鱼跃浦风生。\n已有先行者，烟中闻棹声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客舍喜侄庸至","author":"高启","text":"客里逢人喜，相过况阿宜。\n远游惊岁晚，多难惜门衰。\n帆落江桥近，钟来野店迟。\n一杯灯下语，浑似在家时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭周记室","author":"高启","text":"万里一羁臣，悲歌楚水春。\n漫期重会面，竟作永伤神。\n主祭唯孤侄，收诗有故人。\n独挥闻笛泪，斜日下西邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过永定废寺","author":"高启","text":"乱后僧何去，门闲落叶时。\n画昏秋蠹老，斋断午禽饥。\n罢说传心法，犹看赐额碑。\n不知兴坏理，来此岂无悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枫桥送丁凤","author":"高启","text":"红叶寺前桥，停君晚去桡。\n醉应忘世难，归不计程遥。\n山隐初沉日，风催欲上潮。\n离魂来此处，还似灞陵销。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盗发汉侍中许彧墓","author":"高启","text":"古冢竟谁穿，虚传锢最坚。\n玉鱼宵已出，石兽晓犹眠。\n长夜俄看月，幽台不掩泉。\n须知摸金者，亦到汉陵前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过海昌赠李侯","author":"高启","text":"闲厅昼下帘，秋色满疏髯。\n久戍残兵老，多贫长吏廉。\n阴风潮动郭，晴日地生盐。\n三老相逢说，年来户剩添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送易从事祖饮南渚","author":"高启","text":"疏杨映老荷，别处最秋多。\n送客年年路，愁人日日波。\n霞明添醉色，风急断离歌。\n莫为官程促，青山易看过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张静居画","author":"高启","text":"楚客写荆岑，秋云隔浦阴。\n人家连橘坞，水庙映枫林。\n乱后清游歇，愁边远色深。\n相看休向晚，怕有峡猿吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜怀王校书","author":"高启","text":"灯暗独吟余，疏桐月满除。\n虫寒初入户，鼠饿欲侵书。\n河汉三更望，江湖两地居。\n相思无去梦，今夜恨何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈则见寄","author":"高启","text":"何由慰远思，独咏寄来诗。\n行路方难日，清秋欲尽时。\n江多惊雁火，树少宿乌枝。\n早晚如相见，应怜有鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"煮药","author":"高启","text":"叶燥井泉清，山窗药在铛。\n灯前看火候，枕上听潮声。\n月上吟方就，香来病已轻。\n何时采芝术，养得羽翰成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜投西寺","author":"高启","text":"江月上秋衣，来敲远寺扉。\n栖禽惊客至，睡仆讶僧归。\n钟度行廊尽，灯留浴院微。\n非无招旅馆，禅寂愿相依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送石明府之昆山","author":"高启","text":"茂苑行春罢，携琴又向东。\n潮声数里外，山色半城中。\n帆带桃花雨，衣翻柳叶风。\n岛夷闻善政，为有舶船通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过城西废坞","author":"高启","text":"乱前游最熟，乱后问都迷。\n园散栽花坞，林荒采菊蹊。\n废泉流圃浅，斜月下城低。\n唯有烟中鸟，迎人似旧啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送范架阁赴嘉禾兼简李使君","author":"高启","text":"陆相祠前路，孤舟欲上时。\n空江难晚别，荒郡易秋悲。\n月送潮声早，云随雁去迟。\n幕中知有子，太守只题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜吕山人见过江馆","author":"高启","text":"非君怜夙契，谁肯顾柴门。\n日短清江路，风高大树村。\n交呈新著稿，同发旧藏尊。\n莫便寻归棹，心怀未尽论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠邻友","author":"高启","text":"同居一坞中，只隔水西东。\n林近书灯露，溪回酒舫通。\n放凫长合队，移竹每分丛。\n只恐君征起，难期作两翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿道王兰若","author":"高启","text":"借榻到僧扉，虽安未是归。\n瞑禽愁雪意，夜筱助风威。\n烛尽思燃带，衾寒起覆衣。\n不知孤棹去，明夕更何依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与诗客七人会饮余司马园亭居皆在北郭","author":"高启","text":"情与酒兼和，园亭驻晚珂。\n家同榆社近，人比竹林多。\n短景催长宴，醒吟杂醉歌。\n乱离欢易失，无厌数相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登西涧小阁","author":"高启","text":"层槛构云牢，清寒洒客袍。\n石棱添涧险，阁势借峰高。\n风竹惊栖鸟，霜藤缒饮猱。\n欲题因境胜，不敢易挥毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上答徐卿见赠","author":"高启","text":"烟树近松陵，扁舟晚独乘。\n江黄连渚雾，野白满田冰。\n往事愁人问，虚名畏客称。\n无才任萧散，敢望鹤书征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕客中与家兄守岁","author":"高启","text":"雨雪远村中，猿鸣旅馆空。\n守炉消夜漏，停烛待春风。\n有恨能催老，无文解送穷。\n却怜今夕酒，还与弟兄同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南溪晚归","author":"高启","text":"流水出云根，遥通古寺门。\n山深僧少俗，人静市如村。\n马渡知长浅，鱼行见不浑。\n多情溪上月，归路照黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁孝廉惠冠巾","author":"高启","text":"知试山人服，冠巾远寄重。\n佳名因子夏，旧制学林宗。\n裹映秋吟鬓，欹宜晚醉容。\n朝簪今已解，期上华阳峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园闲兴二首 其一","author":"高启","text":"看到竹过邻，园林独卧身。\n鸟声闲似野，人意倦知春。\n残雨惊池树，斜阳照隙尘。\n如何堂上客，不及燕来频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园闲兴二首 其二","author":"高启","text":"当路阙追攀，端居自掩关。\n听钟知近寺，看画忆登山。\n哓栉风林下，宵吟雨阁间。\n天应怜我懒，独与少年闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢恭","author":"高启","text":"凉风起江海，万树尽秋声。\n摇落岂堪别，踌躇空复情。\n帆过京口渡，砧响石头城。\n为客归宜早，高堂白发生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其一","author":"高启","text":"江水舍西东，邻家是钓翁。\n路痕深草没，井脉暗潮通。\n篱隔蔬边雨，门开竹下风。\n不因时卖畚，何事入城中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其二","author":"高启","text":"此乡堪避地，乱后户翻增。\n俗美嫌欺客，年丰爱施僧。\n带星耕处轭，照雪纺时灯。\n且作求田计，元龙岂我能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其三","author":"高启","text":"幽事向谁夸，孤吟对晚沙。\n浣衣江动月，系艇岸垂花。\n行蚁如知路，归凫自识家。\n一尊茅屋底，随意答春华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其四","author":"高启","text":"春泥桑下路，孤策自扶行。\n身贱知农事，心闲见物情。\n鱼鸣风欲起，牛饭月初生。\n渐喜无人识，何烦易姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其五","author":"高启","text":"移家到渚滨，沙鸟便相亲。\n地僻偏容懒，村荒却称贫。\n犬随春馌女，鸡唤晓耕人。\n愿得无愁事，闲眠老此身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其六","author":"高启","text":"纷纷谢人役，寂寂恋吾居。\n细雨春雩后，斜阳社饮余。\n岸花飞趣蝶，池叶堕惊鱼。\n好了公家事，休令吏到庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其七","author":"高启","text":"路迂桥断处，门静犊眠时。\n孤墅藏群柳，诸田灌一陂。\n僮闲春作少，妇懒午炊迟。\n谁道花源好，还令太守知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其八","author":"高启","text":"虚阁近鸣湍，应宜把一竿。\n雨伤春麦烂，风折晚蒲干。\n抱瓮临江汲，携书入寺看。\n自惭何独幸，世难此偷安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其九","author":"高启","text":"乱渚交交白，平芜漫漫青。\n卖薪沙店远，祈谷水祠灵。\n密雨侵蓑重，微风过网腥。\n江边多酒伴，春去不曾醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十","author":"高启","text":"入夜潮侵户，经秋雨坏垣。\n里人淳少讼，田父醉多言。\n稻蟹灯前聚，莎虫机下喧。\n自应耽野趣，不是忘乡园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十一","author":"高启","text":"欲沽嗟市远，烟火隔江波。\n客到寒斋少，人归晚渡多。\n污书灯烬落，惊枕橹声过。\n岂敢愁荒寂，时危免负戈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十二","author":"高启","text":"野色迥苍苍，开门叶满塘。\n僧来双屐雨，渔卧一船霜。\n静里修香传，闲中录酒方。\n平生当世意，到此坐成忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十三","author":"高启","text":"红树南江近，青山北郭遥。\n江清目渺渺，林冷发萧萧。\n食鲙知晨钓，听歌识暮樵。\n寻常送归客，不过水西桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十四","author":"高启","text":"何处可徘徊，林间共水隈。\n夜归家犬识，春睡野禽催。\n有地唯栽药，无村不见梅。\n兴来惭独饮，时唤老农陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十五","author":"高启","text":"狂多爱出游，日日问江头。\n小草皆春意，遥山自晚愁。\n酒中时有得，物外复何求。\n不咏骚人调，蘼芜任满洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊墅杂赋（十六首） 其十六","author":"高启","text":"居似临邛宅，耕非鄠杜田。\n已偿输税米，未觅卖文钱。\n把卷怜长日，看花愧少年。\n翛然闭门处，杨柳桔槔边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何记室游湖州","author":"高启","text":"暮雨关城独去迟，少年心事剑相知。\n故人当路轻贫贱，倦客逢秋恶别离。\n疏柳一旗江上酒，乱山孤棹道中诗。\n水嬉散后湖亭废，此去烦君吊牧之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上寄丁校理昆季","author":"高启","text":"望里烟生是子家，草堂应近脊令沙。\n江汀每恨无舟渡，野墅空怜有酒赊。\n半雨暮城风外雪，孤梅春动腊中花。\n相思尚隔前村远，独倚柴门数去鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾军咨归梁溪","author":"高启","text":"新柳休攀短短条，离愁似雪未能销。\n春回废苑还芳草，人渡空江正落潮。\n德曜宅前今独去，平津门下旧相招。\n重来莫在花开后，拟听狂歌醉几朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白莲寺次韵杜进士喜予见过话旧之作","author":"高启","text":"不辞鸣棹远相寻，欲向江斋伴旅吟。\n百事未成年已长，几时才别夏将深。\n萱留倦蝶连池绿，树带残莺满寺阴。\n恐被老僧嫌滞碍，旧游休说更伤心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"期徐七游云岩","author":"高启","text":"忆与青山别几时，云松应恨鹤归迟。\n少知学道贫非病，闲爱谈禅偈是诗。\n女浣晓江烟渺渺，人行暮苑麦离离。\n明朝风雨还同往，恐负高僧石上期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]